{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#card-zh","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型路由插件：它把多个供应商的模型组织成统一 ModelID 下的候选链，并在 DSH 的模型流处理中选择和切换候选。主要功能包括按轻量、标准、强大三档路由，首个内容输出前失败时重试或切换供应商，依据近期健康记录调整候选顺序，以及按估算上下文容量跳过不适用的模型。设置页可编辑路由和模型能力，对话窗口可选择套餐与档位并查看当前路由状态。适合需要在多个模型供应商之间分配 DSH 请求、设置备用模型或按任务切换模型档位的用户。需要配置宿主可用的模型供应商；插件自身没有固定 API Key 配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:334-506","lib/index.js:507-622","lib/client.js:351-413","lib/client.js:1192-1206"]}
{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#card-en","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-router routes DSH web requests across providers behind one model name. It offers three tiers, retry and failover, health-based ordering, and context-size filtering. The settings panel edits routes and model capabilities; the chat picker selects plans and tiers.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:334-506","lib/index.js:507-622","lib/client.js:351-413","lib/client.js:1192-1206"]}
