{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#feature-1","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「候选故障切换」：请求在首个内容前遇到可转移错误时可重试当前模型，失败后尝试候选链的后续模型，并为失败候选设置冷却。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:334-506"]}
{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#feature-2","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「三档任务路由」：根据明确的 tier、轻量任务 purpose 或会话手动选择确定 tier1/2/3，并在所选档位为空时逐级降档。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.mjs:207-227","lib/index.js:105-161"]}
{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#feature-3","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「健康度排序」：路由候选根据近期成功与失败记录重新排序，较稳定的候选优先；设置中可关闭该排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.mjs:124-166","lib/index.js:262-278","lib/index.js:507-531"]}
{"unit_id":"welsione__dsh-model-router#feature-4","repo":"welsione/dsh-model-router","commit":"b30a0b3d5adaafc51e9f691a99fc2eaa747070ec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-router 的功能「上下文容量筛选」：发送前估算请求 token 量并检查候选窗口，跳过预计放不下的模型；如果估算筛掉全部候选则继续尝试原链。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/core.mjs:253-345","lib/index.js:342-366"]}
